# 📄 PROJECT SPECIFICATION

## Project Name

**ABMS-LLM Cyber Organizational Simulation (V0.1 – Rule-Based Core)**

---

# 1️⃣ Project Objective

Build a modular Agent-Based Modeling and Simulation (ABMS) system using **Mesa** to evaluate how different organizational structures affect performance in a multi-stage cyber operation.

This is Version 0.1:

* No LLM integration yet
* Rule-based cognition only
* Fully modular
* Designed for future LLM plug-in replacement

